01:00:30,000 --> 01:00:36,000
Vivarium is a 2019 science fiction psychological thriller film directed by
Lorcan Finnegan, from a story by Finnegan and Garret Shanley.

12
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Shanley also wrote the screenplay.

13
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
An international co-production of Ireland, Denmark and Belgium, it stars
Imogen Poots, Jesse Eisenberg, Jonathan Aris, and Éanna Hardwicke.

14
01:17:00,000 --> 01:17:06,000
The film follows a couple (Eisenberg and Poots) who are forced to care for a mysterious
humanoid creature while trapped in a strange, vivarium-like neighbourhood.

15
01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
It had its world premiere at the Cannes Film Festival on 18 May 2019, and was
released in Ireland on 27 March 2020 by Vertigo Releasing.

16
01:28:00,000 --> 01:28:06,000
The film explores themes of baby, suburbia, suburb, trapped, cynical.

17
01:33:30,000 --> 01:33:36,000
The tone is dark and mind_bending and thought_provoking.
